      "updated": 1792438700349,
      "created": 1792234127973,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mic, local recognizer, Arabic TTS, SMS, GPS, DB.\nHistory, favorites, emergency and channel check\nneed no backend.\nCommands: STOP · RESUME · GIVE_GESTURE ·\nCONFIRM · CANCEL · EMERGENCY (button = gesture)",
      "originalText": "Mic, local recognizer, Arabic TTS, SMS, GPS, DB.\nHistory, favorites, emergency and channel check\nneed no backend.\nCommands: STOP · RESUME · GIVE_GESTURE ·\nCONFIRM · CANCEL · EMERGENCY (button = gesture)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b34"
    },
