      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rest 5 s + movements → scale, bad channels,\nrotation shift, quality (good / acceptable / redo).\nPhone applies: rotate → ÷ scale → mask channels.\nServer gets normalized signal + profile version.",
      "originalText": "Rest 5 s + movements → scale, bad channels,\nrotation shift, quality (good / acceptable / redo).\nPhone applies: rotate → ÷ scale → mask channels.\nServer gets normalized signal + profile version.",
